}</script>"}},{"widget_id":"4b311a94","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Si bien nuestra instalación de East Dallas está aquí para brindar atención que salva vidas, comprender la prevención de derrames cerebrales es igual de importante para proteger a su familia. La presión arterial alta es la causa principal de derrames cerebrales y sangrados cerebrales. Si usted o un ser querido tiene un historial de hipertensión, tomar medidas proactivas es vital:</p><ul><li><strong>Controle la Presión Arterial:</strong> Revise sus niveles regularmente y tome todos los medicamentos recetados.</li><li><strong>Controle la Diabetes:</strong> El azúcar alta en la sangre daña los vasos sanguíneos con el tiempo y aumenta los riesgos de coágulos.</li><li><strong>Deje de Fumar:</strong> Fumar espesa su sangre y aumenta drásticamente la posibilidad de acumulación de placa.</li><li><strong>Esté atento a las Señales de Advertencia:</strong> Mareo repentino, dolores de cabeza severos inexplicables o pérdida temporal de la visión son señales de advertencia que requieren llamar al 911 de inmediato.</li></ul>"}},{"widget_id":"5fcfb78c","widget_type":"button","settings":{"link":{"url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/ER+of+White+Rock+-+Emergency+Room/@32.8646409,-96.7000306,732m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x864ea131f0fa1a1f:0x4aa8c9e03bdf42c2!8m2!3d32.8646409!4d-96.7000306!16s%2Fg%2F11vynyfmnc","is_external":"on","nofollow":""}}},{"widget_id":"898932f","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Use este formulario para preguntas de rutina y <a href="https://erofwhiterock.com/insurance-billing-info/">consultas de facturación</a>. No se supervisa para emergencias. Si cree que tiene una emergencia médica, llame al 911 y no espere una respuesta por este medio.</p>"}}]}

{"section_id":"","widget_updates":[{"widget_id":"d7f4d6f","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>If you suspect a stroke, call 911 for an ambulance. Do not drive or wait for symptoms to pass.</p><p>ER of White Rock provides emergency evaluation, CT imaging and initial stabilization 24 hours a day. When specialist care is needed, we coordinate transfer to an appropriate facility.</p>"}},{"widget_id":"7a40c42e","widget_type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Suspected Stroke? Call 911","link":{"url":"tel:911","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}}},{"widget_id":"261e9fcc","widget_type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Stroke Warning Signs: Act Immediately"}},{"widget_id":"111e7fa0","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Sudden loss of balance or vision, face drooping, arm weakness and speech trouble can signal a stroke. A sudden severe headache is another warning sign. <a href="https://www.cdc.gov/stroke/signs-symptoms/index.html">CDC guidance recommends calling 911</a>, even if the symptoms go away.</p><p>Treatment depends on whether a clot blocks blood flow or there is bleeding in the brain. Clot-busting medicines may help selected patients with an ischemic stroke; they do not treat a hemorrhagic stroke. See the <a href="https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/stroke/treatment">NIH treatment guidance</a>.</p><p>Stroke recognition is one piece of broader cardiovascular awareness. Our <a href="https://erofwhiterock.com/cardiovascular-emergencies-near-white-rock-lake/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cardiovascular emergencies guide near White Rock</a> covers heart attack, stroke, and blood clot warning signs.</p>"}},{"widget_id":"6931d24a","widget_type":"flip-box","settings":{"description_text_b":"Our emergency team is available around the clock. For suspected stroke, call 911 so emergency responders can determine the appropriate destination."}},{"widget_id":"627745bb","widget_type":"flip-box","settings":{"description_text_b":"CT imaging helps evaluate possible bleeding in the brain. Clinicians interpret the images alongside symptoms and the neurological examination."}},{"widget_id":"af6b803","widget_type":"flip-box","settings":{"title_text_a":"Treatment Assessment","title_text_b":"Treatment Assessment","description_text_b":"Decisions about medicines and procedures depend on stroke type, symptom timing and the medical team’s assessment."}},{"widget_id":"641727e","widget_type":"flip-box","settings":{"description_text_b":"We coordinate medical transfer when neurological care, neurosurgery or other specialist services are needed."}},{"widget_id":"b492b12","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>If someone has stroke warning signs:</p><ul><li><strong>Call 911:</strong> Request an ambulance immediately.</li><li><strong>Record the time:</strong> Note when symptoms began or when the person was last known to be well.</li><li><strong>Follow instructions:</strong> Stay with the person and follow the 911 dispatcher’s directions.</li><li><strong>Do not wait:</strong> Do not delay to see whether symptoms improve.</li></ul>"}},{"widget_id":"1db51ab2","widget_type":"button","settings":{"text":"Call 911","link":{"url":"tel:911","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}}},{"widget_id":"bdf1e05","widget_type":"button","settings":{"text":"Call 911","link":{"url":"tel:911","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}}},{"widget_id":"b6242da","widget_type":"button","settings":{"text":"Call 911","link":{"url":"tel:911","is_external":"on","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""}}},{"widget_id":"640abf8","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Our team evaluates symptoms, provides initial stabilization and coordinates specialist care when needed. Care depends on each patient’s condition and needs.</p>"}},{"widget_id":"4270172","widget_type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Call 911 for a Suspected Stroke"}},{"widget_id":"4f886c3","widget_type":"text-editor","settings":{"e